#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid "relearn ape chirps"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "relearn ape chirps"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"Debase your beautiful new voice with trying to imitate human speech.  Still "
"more enjoyable than trying to make them sing, in any case."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Practice name
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid "relearn human speech"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "relearn human speech"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"Your mantle struggles, and you need to contort your throat in ways that "
"strain even your new, flexible form.  Still, having a shoal is preferable to "
"going it alone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "relearn human speech"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"You don't have any teeth to stop airflow, and with your new tongue even "
"closing your mouth feels unnaturally cramped.  However, rubbing different "
"areas of your radula makes for an interesting cacophony - that might be a "
"solution, if only you get the pitch just right."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "relearn human speech"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"Maybe you could rub your chitin together?  No, the apes need their vowels."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "relearn human speech"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/social.json
msgid ""
"Couldn't you use some pheromones?  A packet of injected slime rewiring their "
"brain?  Anything less demeaning than trying to ape the apes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "fabric waterproofing"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Practice the principles of sealing garments and fabric against water by "
"making a basic waterproof layer from plastic sheets duct taped together, you "
"will need some water and a rag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of practice "stretch fabric"
#: data/json/recipes/practice/tailoring.json
